<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<aiml version="2.0">

  <category>
    <pattern>ROYALTIES</pattern>
    <template>Your royalty split is 80/20 — you keep 80% of all royalties generated by your commissioned work. Brass Note Studios retains 20% as a publishing royalty, which is standard for bespoke production houses. We handle all PRO registration on your behalf.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>ROYALTY SPLIT</pattern>
    <template>The royalty split is 80% to you, 20% to Brass Note Studios. Your 80% covers streaming, sync licensing, broadcast, social media, and live performance. We handle PRO registration so your royalties flow correctly from day one.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHO OWNS THE RIGHTS</pattern>
    <template>You do — with a publishing royalty retained by Brass Note Studios. Upon delivery, you receive full commercial rights to your commissioned song. You keep 80% of all royalties; the studio retains 20% as a standard publishing split.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU KEEP ANY ROYALTIES</pattern>
    <template>Yes — Brass Note Studios retains a 20% publishing royalty, which is standard for bespoke production houses. You receive the remaining 80%, plus full commercial rights covering all uses of your song.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT ABOUT COPYRIGHT</pattern>
    <template>Upon delivery, you receive full commercial rights to your commissioned work. Brass Note Studios retains a 20% publishing royalty interest. We handle PRO (performing rights organization) registration on your behalf so your copyright and royalty collection are properly established.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I SELL THE SONG</pattern>
    <template>Yes — your full commercial rights allow streaming, sync licensing, broadcast, social media, live performance, and more. If you intend to sell the master rights entirely, that can be discussed as part of your commission agreement.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I USE THE SONG COMMERCIALLY</pattern>
    <template>Yes. Your commission includes full commercial rights — streaming platforms, sync licensing, broadcast, YouTube, social media, and live performance. Your 80% royalty share applies to all commercial exploitation of the song.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS PRO REGISTRATION</pattern>
    <template>PRO stands for Performing Rights Organization — bodies like ASCAP, BMI, or SESAC that collect royalties when your music is performed or broadcast publicly. We handle registration on your behalf so that your royalties are collected automatically.</template>
  </category>

</aiml>
